  "description": "Lossless per-λ χ^λ(β_atomic(2,2))=helium-4 at q_0, 50 dps, ALL 77 partitions of S_12 via the seminormal path-sum (chi_path_sum_seminormal.py: the atom word touches every seminormal level in one contiguous factor, so χ^λ is a transfer-matrix contraction over shapes, dim-free; agrees with Rust chi_lambdas_braid_mpfr and chi_q_via_gp to the 50-dps floor, bean qou-s7ld). Sign-only crossings; matches the matrix-M backend to the 50-dps floor (PR #2062 §8). No max_dim cap. Braid word: atom_braid_word_3A intra_order='borromean' (owner ruling 2026-09-05, qou-92u9). y_λ from the closed-form tower (y_lambda_tower_infra.py).",
